{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637460/extras/boombrella.gif?t=1745852900\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WATCH OUT, DON'T GET WET!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an <strong>Intense and Frenetic</strong> action-platformer roguelike, where quick reflexes and creativity are essential to survive against hordes of <strong>Demons</strong>. Step into the shoes of a <strong>Cat in a Raincoat</strong> embarking on a hellish journey, using a trusty <strong>Umbrella</strong> to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637460/extras/gunbrella.gif?t=1745852900\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT'S AVAILABLE IN THE DEMO VERSION?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can test the game's core mechanics and explore the unique abilities of umbrellas while descending through 8 layers of challenges!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with the <strong>Boombrella</strong> or the <strong>Gunbrella</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your gameplay with over 40 types of upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of enemy types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637460/extras/safezone.gif?t=1745852900\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DON'T FORGET!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cats don't like getting wet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add Hellbrella to your wishlist so you don't miss the full release!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637460?t=1745852900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637460/d1c7b64f870e6c6233acee69ef1da90fe598fc23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745852900","capsule_image":"http